    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><em>奇物，非普通</em><br />這副由象牙或牛皮紙而製成的紙牌以 <strong>萬象無常牌Deck of Many Things</strong> 的形象爲原型而製作，可爲使用它的人帶來各種小好處和懲罰。大多數（75%）牌組只有13張牌，其餘的則有22張牌。<br />抽卡之前，你必須先聲明要抽多少張卡牌，然後隨機抽取（你可以使用撲克牌模擬牌組）。繼續抽取聲明數量之外更多的卡牌將不會產生任何效應。按正常方法抽出的卡牌其魔法效應在抽出時立即生效。你抽取兩張卡牌之間的間隔不能超過1小時。如果你未能抽夠聲明數量的卡牌，聲明瞭但是未抽取的那部分卡牌將從牌組中自行飛出並同時生效。除非你抽到的是神祕 Mystery卡，否則抽出的卡型將立刻生效，消失，然後重新出現在牌組裏，使得你可能再次抽到該卡。<br />你可以使用一副經過改良的撲克牌來模擬這副牌組，如 \"奇蹟牌組 \"表所示。</p><table class=\"w-100 rd__table  stripe-odd-table\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Deck of Wonder\"><caption><strong>奇蹟牌組</strong></caption><thead><tr><th class=\"rd__th ve-col-4 ve-text-center \" data-rd-isroller=\"true\">[[/r 1d22]]{撲克牌}</th><th class=\"rd__th ve-col-8 \" data-rd-isroller=\"false\">卡牌</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-4 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"1\" data-roll-max=\"1\">A <span class=\"rd__color\" style=\"color:#ff0000\">♦</span></td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-8 \">@card[Chancellor|Deck of Wonder|BMT]*</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-4 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"2\" data-roll-max=\"2\">K <span class=\"rd__color\" style=\"color:#ff0000\">♦</span></td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-8 \">@card[Day|Deck of Wonder|BMT]</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-4 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"3\" data-roll-max=\"3\">Q <span class=\"rd__color\" style=\"color:#ff0000\">♦</span></td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-8 \">@card[Night|Deck of Wonder|BMT]</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-4 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"4\" data-roll-max=\"4\">J <span class=\"rd__color\" style=\"color:#ff0000\">♦</span></td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-8 \">@card[Dawn|Deck of Wonder|BMT]</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-4 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"5\" data-roll-max=\"5\">2 <span class=\"rd__color\" style=\"color:#ff0000\">♦</span></td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-8 \">@card[Dusk|Deck of Wonder|BMT]*</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-4 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"6\" data-roll-max=\"6\">A <span class=\"rd__color\" style=\"color:#ff0000\">♥</span></td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-8 \">@card[Destiny|Deck of Wonder|BMT]*</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-4 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"7\" data-roll-max=\"7\">K <span class=\"rd__color\" style=\"color:#ff0000\">♥</span></td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-8 \">@card[Crown|Deck of Wonder|BMT]</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-4 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"8\" data-roll-max=\"8\">Q <span class=\"rd__color\" style=\"color:#ff0000\">♥</span></td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-8 \">@card[Lock|Deck of Wonder|BMT]</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-4 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"9\" data-roll-max=\"9\">J <span class=\"rd__color\" style=\"color:#ff0000\">♥</span></td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-8 \">@card[Champion|Deck of Wonder|BMT]</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-4 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"10\" data-roll-max=\"10\">2 <span class=\"rd__color\" style=\"color:#ff0000\">♥</span></td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-8 \">@card[Coin|Deck of Wonder|BMT]*</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-4 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"11\" data-roll-max=\"11\">A ♣</td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-8 \">@card[Vulture|Deck of Wonder|BMT]*</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-4 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"12\" data-roll-max=\"12\">K ♣</td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-8 \">@card[Chaos|Deck of Wonder|BMT]</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-4 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"13\" data-roll-max=\"13\">Q ♣</td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-8 \">@card[Order|Deck of Wonder|BMT]</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-4 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"14\" data-roll-max=\"14\">J ♣</td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-8 \">@card[Beginning|Deck of Wonder|BMT]</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-4 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"15\" data-roll-max=\"15\">2 ♣</td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-8 \">@card[Mystery|Deck of Wonder|BMT]*</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-4 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"16\" data-roll-max=\"16\">A ♠</td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-8 \">@card[Isolation|Deck of Wonder|BMT]*</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-4 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"17\" data-roll-max=\"17\">K ♠</td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-8 \">@card[End|Deck of Wonder|BMT]</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-4 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"18\" data-roll-max=\"18\">Q ♠</td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-8 \">@card[Monster|Deck of Wonder|BMT]</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-4 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"19\" data-roll-max=\"19\">J ♠</td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-8 \">@card[Knife|Deck of Wonder|BMT]</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-4 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"20\" data-roll-max=\"20\">2 ♠</td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-8 \">@card[Justice|Deck of Wonder|BMT]*</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-4 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"21\" data-roll-max=\"21\">Joker (with ™)</td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-8 \">@card[Student|Deck of Wonder|BMT]*</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-4 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"22\" data-roll-max=\"22\">Joker (without ™)</td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-8 \">@card[Mischief|Deck of Wonder|BMT]</td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>開始 Beginning。</strong>你的當前生命值及其上限增加[[/r 2d10]]，以這種方式增加生命值上限的效應持續8小時。</p><p><strong>勇士 Champion。</strong>你的武器攻擊和傷害擲骰獲得+1加值。該增益持續8小時。</p><p><strong>大臣 Chancellor。</strong>在抽到此卡後的8小時內，你可以用動作施展一次<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.new-icon.Item.umqpL5B9ccbkpJtJ]{卜筮術 Augury}</em>  ，且無需材料成分。使用智力、感知、或魅力作爲施法屬性（由你選擇）。</p><p><strong>混沌 Chaos。</strong>你獲得下列中的一種傷害抗性（由DM選擇）：強酸、寒冷、火焰、閃電、雷鳴。此抗性持續[[/r 1d12]]日。</p><p><strong>硬幣 Coin。</strong>五件珠寶（每件價值100gp），或十顆寶石（每顆價值50gp），出現在你腳邊。</p><p><strong>皇冠 Crown。</strong>你習得戲法<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.new-icon.Item.JqyWE42E4J9IR1au]{交友術 friends}</em>。使用智力、感知、或魅力作爲施法屬性（由你選擇）。如果你已知該戲法，此卡沒有效果。</p><p><strong>黎明 Dawn。</strong>這張牌能讓你精神振奮。在接下來的8小時內，你可以將你的熟練加值加入你的先攻檢定中。</p><p><strong>白晝 Day。</strong>你的豁免檢定獲得+1加值。該增益持續到你完成一次長休爲止。</p><p><strong>宿命 Destiny。</strong>這張卡可以保護你避免過早死亡。抽到此卡後，你首次因受到傷害而生命值降爲0時，你改爲降至1點生命值。</p><p><strong>黃昏 Dusk。</strong>這張牌會超自然地消耗你的能量。你進行的先攻檢定具有劣勢。此效果會持續到你完成一次長休爲止，不過它可以被<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.new-icon.Item.ewDH2w8w2yLSM021]{移除詛咒 Remove Curse}</em>或類似的魔法提前終止。</p><p><strong>結束 End。</strong>這張牌是死亡的預兆。你受到[[/damage 2d10 type=necrotic]]傷害，並且你的生命值上限會降低，降低的程度等同你受到的傷害（該效果無法將你的生命值上限降至10以下），該減損持續到你完成一次長休。但它可以被<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.new-icon.Item.ewDH2w8w2yLSM021]{移除詛咒 Remove Curse}</em>或類似的魔法提前終止。</p><p><strong>隔離 isolation。</strong>你和你所穿戴或攜帶的任何東西一起消失，並被困在一個無害的超次元空間中[[/r 1d4]]分鐘。你不能再抽牌。之後你重新出現在你之前所在的空間或最近的未佔據空間。當你再次出現時，你必須成功通過一次[[/save ability=con dc=11]]豁免，否則你的身體因在次元旅行中搖擺而陷入 中毒Poisoned 狀態1小時。</p><p><strong>正義Justice。</strong>你暫時獲得了平衡命運天平的能力。在接下來的8小時內，每當你或你周圍60尺內的生物即將投出具有優勢或劣勢的[[/r d20]]時，你可以用你的反應來防止該次投擲受到優勢或劣勢的影響。</p><p><strong>刀刃 Knife。</strong>一把你熟練的、非普通稀有度的魔法武器出現在你的手中。具體武器由DM選擇。</p><p><strong>枷鎖 Lock。</strong>你獲得[[/r 1d3]]次施展<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.new-icon.Item.VC9nFuUxF7yptXK5]{敲擊術 Knock}</em>的能力。使用你的智力、感知、或魅力作爲施法屬性（由你選擇）。</p><p><strong>惡戲 Mischief。</strong>你收到一件非普通魔法物品（由DM選擇），或者你在聲明的抽卡數量外再額外抽兩張卡牌。</p><p><strong>怪物 Monster。</strong>這張卡的怪物面容詛咒了你。以這種方式被詛咒期間，每當你進行一次豁免時，你必須投擲一顆[[/r 1d4]]，並從結果中減去擲出的數值。詛咒會持續到你完成一次長休，但它可以被<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.new-icon.Item.ewDH2w8w2yLSM021]{移除詛咒 Remove Curse}</em>或類似的魔法提前終止。</p><p><strong>神祕 Mystery。</strong>接下來的1小時內，你進行的智力豁免具有劣勢。棄掉這張牌並再從牌組中抽一張牌：這兩張抽牌僅視爲你聲明的抽牌數量中的“一次”。</p><p><strong>黑夜 Night。</strong>你獲得300尺黑暗視覺，持續8小時。</p><p><strong>秩序 Order。</strong>你獲得下列中的一種傷害抗性（由DM選擇）：力場、暗蝕、毒素、心靈、光耀。這種抗性持續[[/r 1d12]]日。</p><p><strong>學徒 Student。</strong>你獲得感知豁免的熟練項，若你已擁有此熟練項，你改爲獲得智力或魅力豁免熟練項（由你選擇）。</p><p><strong>禿鷲 Vulture。</strong>你所擁有的一件非魔法物品或裝備（由DM選擇）消失。該物品會停留在附近，但會隱藏一小段時間，通過一次[[/save ability=wis dc=15]] (察覺)檢定後即可被發現。如果該物品在1小時內未被找回。它將永遠消失。</p><p>Created in the image of the Deck of Many Things, this deck of ivory or vellum cards bestows an assortment of minor benefits and penalties on those who draw from it. Most (75 percent) of these decks have only thirteen cards, but the rest have twenty-two.</p><p>Before you draw a card, you must declare how many cards you intend to draw, then draw them randomly. Any additional cards drawn have no effect. Unless a card states otherwise, as soon as you draw a card from the deck, its magic takes effect. You must draw each card you declared no more than 1 hour after the previous draw. If you fail to draw the chosen number, the remaining number of cards fly from the deck and take effect simultaneously.</p><p>Unless it is the Mystery card, a drawn card immediately takes effect, fades from existence, and reappears in the deck, making it possible to draw the same card multiple times.</p><p>You can use an altered deck of playing cards to simulate the deck, as shown in the <em>Deck of Wonder</em> table.</p><table class=\"w-100 rd__table  stripe-odd-table\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Deck of Wonder\"><caption>Deck of Wonder</caption><thead><tr><th class=\"rd__th ve-col-4 ve-text-center \" data-rd-isroller=\"true\">[[/r 1d22]]{Card}</th><th class=\"rd__th ve-col-8 \" data-rd-isroller=\"false\">Card Title</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-4 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"1\" data-roll-max=\"1\">A <span class=\"rd__color\" style=\"color:#ff0000\">♦</span></td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-8 \">@card[Chancellor|Deck of Wonder|BMT]*</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-4 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"2\" data-roll-max=\"2\">K <span class=\"rd__color\" style=\"color:#ff0000\">♦</span></td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-8 \">@card[Day|Deck of Wonder|BMT]</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-4 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"3\" data-roll-max=\"3\">Q <span class=\"rd__color\" style=\"color:#ff0000\">♦</span></td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-8 \">@card[Night|Deck of Wonder|BMT]</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-4 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"4\" data-roll-max=\"4\">J <span class=\"rd__color\" style=\"color:#ff0000\">♦</span></td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-8 \">@card[Dawn|Deck of Wonder|BMT]</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-4 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"5\" data-roll-max=\"5\">2 <span class=\"rd__color\" style=\"color:#ff0000\">♦</span></td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-8 \">@card[Dusk|Deck of Wonder|BMT]*</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-4 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"6\" data-roll-max=\"6\">A <span class=\"rd__color\" style=\"color:#ff0000\">♥</span></td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-8 \">@card[Destiny|Deck of Wonder|BMT]*</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-4 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"7\" data-roll-max=\"7\">K <span class=\"rd__color\" style=\"color:#ff0000\">♥</span></td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-8 \">@card[Crown|Deck of Wonder|BMT]</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-4 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"8\" data-roll-max=\"8\">Q <span class=\"rd__color\" style=\"color:#ff0000\">♥</span></td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-8 \">@card[Lock|Deck of Wonder|BMT]</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-4 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"9\" data-roll-max=\"9\">J <span class=\"rd__color\" style=\"color:#ff0000\">♥</span></td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-8 \">@card[Champion|Deck of Wonder|BMT]</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-4 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"10\" data-roll-max=\"10\">2 <span class=\"rd__color\" style=\"color:#ff0000\">♥</span></td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-8 \">@card[Coin|Deck of Wonder|BMT]*</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-4 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"11\" data-roll-max=\"11\">A ♣</td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-8 \">@card[Vulture|Deck of Wonder|BMT]*</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-4 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"12\" data-roll-max=\"12\">K ♣</td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-8 \">@card[Chaos|Deck of Wonder|BMT]</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-4 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"13\" data-roll-max=\"13\">Q ♣</td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-8 \">@card[Order|Deck of Wonder|BMT]</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-4 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"14\" data-roll-max=\"14\">J ♣</td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-8 \">@card[Beginning|Deck of Wonder|BMT]</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-4 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"15\" data-roll-max=\"15\">2 ♣</td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-8 \">@card[Mystery|Deck of Wonder|BMT]*</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-4 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"16\" data-roll-max=\"16\">A ♠</td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-8 \">@card[Isolation|Deck of Wonder|BMT]*</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-4 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"17\" data-roll-max=\"17\">K ♠</td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-8 \">@card[End|Deck of Wonder|BMT]</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-4 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"18\" data-roll-max=\"18\">Q ♠</td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-8 \">@card[Monster|Deck of Wonder|BMT]</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-4 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"19\" data-roll-max=\"19\">J ♠</td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-8 \">@card[Knife|Deck of Wonder|BMT]</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-4 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"20\" data-roll-max=\"20\">2 ♠</td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-8 \">@card[Justice|Deck of Wonder|BMT]*</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-4 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"21\" data-roll-max=\"21\">Joker (with ™)</td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-8 \">@card[Student|Deck of Wonder|BMT]*</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-4 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"22\" data-roll-max=\"22\">Joker (without ™)</td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-8 \">@card[Mischief|Deck of Wonder|BMT]</td></tr></tbody></table><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Beginning\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Beginning.</span> Your hit point maximum and current hit points increase by [[/r 2d10]]. Your hit point maximum remains increased in this way for the next 8 hours.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Champion\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Champion.</span> You gain a +1 bonus to weapon attack and damage rolls. This bonus lasts for 8 hours.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Chancellor\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Chancellor.</span> Within 8 hours of drawing this card, you can cast @spell[Augury] once as an action, requiring no material components. Use your Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma as the spellcasting ability (your choice).</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Chaos\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Chaos.</span> You gain resistance to one of the following damage types (chosen by the DM): acid, cold, fire, lightning, or thunder. This resistance lasts for [[/r 1d12]] days.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Coin\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Coin.</span> Five pieces of jewelry, each worth 100 gp, or ten gemstones, each worth 50 gp, appear at your feet.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Crown\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Crown.</span> You learn the @spell[Friends] cantrip. Use your Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma as the spellcasting ability (your choice). If you already know this cantrip, the card has no effect.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Dawn\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Dawn.</span> This card invigorates you. For the next 8 hours, you can add your proficiency bonus to your initiative rolls.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Day\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Day.</span> You gain a +1 bonus to saving throws. This benefit lasts until you finish a long rest.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Destiny\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Destiny.</span> This card protects you against an untimely demise. The first time after drawing this card that you would drop to 0 hit points from taking damage, you instead drop to 1 hit point.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Dusk\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Dusk.</span> This card supernaturally saps your energy. You have disadvantage on initiative rolls. This effect lasts until you finish a long rest, but it can be ended early by a @spell[Remove Curse] spell or similar magic.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"End\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">End.</span> This card is an omen of death. You take [[/damage 2d10 type=necrotic]] damage, and your hit point maximum is reduced by an amount equal to the damage taken. This effect can't reduce your hit point maximum below 10 hit points. This reduction lasts until you finish a long rest, but it can be ended early by a @spell[Remove Curse] spell or similar magic.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Isolation\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Isolation.</span> You disappear, along with anything you are wearing or carrying, and become trapped in a harmless extradimensional space for [[/r 1d4]] minutes. You draw no more cards. You then reappear in the space you left or the nearest unoccupied space. When you reappear, you must succeed on a [[/save ability=con dc=11]] saving throw or have the poisoned condition for 1 hour as your body reels from the extradimensional travel.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Justice\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Justice.</span> You momentarily gain the ability to balance the scales of fate. For the next 8 hours, whenever you or a creature within 60 feet of you is about to roll a [[/r d20]] with advantage or disadvantage, you can use your reaction to prevent the roll from being affected by advantage or disadvantage.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Knife\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Knife.</span> An uncommon magic weapon you're proficient with appears in your hands. The DM chooses the weapon.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Lock\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Lock.</span> You gain the ability to cast @spell[Knock] [[/r 1d3]] times. Use your Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma as the spellcasting ability (your choice).</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Mischief\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Mischief.</span> You receive an uncommon wondrous item (chosen by the DM), or you can draw two additional cards beyond your declared draws.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Monster\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Monster.</span> This card's monstrous visage curses you. While cursed in this way, whenever you make a saving throw, you must roll [[/r 1d4]] and subtract the number rolled from the total. The curse lasts until you finish a long rest, but it can be ended early with a @spell[Remove Curse] spell or similar magic.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Mystery\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Mystery.</span> You have disadvantage on Intelligence saving throws for 1 hour. Discard this card and draw from the deck again; together, the two draws count as one of your declared draws.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Night\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Night.</span> You gain &amp;Reference[rule=darkvision] within a range of 300 feet. This &amp;Reference[rule=darkvision] lasts for 8 hours.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Order\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Order.</span> You gain resistance to one of the following damage types (chosen by the DM): force, necrotic, poison, psychic, or radiant. This resistance lasts for [[/r 1d12]] days.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Student\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Student.</span> You gain proficiency in Wisdom saving throws. If you already have this proficiency, you instead gain proficiency in Intelligence or Charisma saving throws (your choice).</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Vulture\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Vulture.</span> One nonmagical item or piece of equipment in your possession (chosen by the DM) disappears. The item remains nearby but concealed for a short time, so it can be found with a successful [[/save ability=wis dc=15]] (&amp;Reference[skill=Perception]) check. If the item isn't recovered within 1 hour, it disappears forever.</p></div></div>",
